Lab 6: Working with Content Collections
Objectives

By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

• Understand what Ansible Content Collections are and their benefits • Download and install content collections from Ansible Galaxy • Browse and explore collection contents and documentation • Use roles from collections in your playbooks • Implement collection-based automation solutions • Troubleshoot common collection-related issues
