Before starting this lab, you should have:

• Basic understanding of Ansible fundamentals (playbooks, roles, tasks) • Familiarity with YAML syntax • Experience running Ansible commands from the command line • Knowledge of Linux command-line operations • Understanding of SSH key-based authentication
